OL,3,AFarage threatens to overhaul Lords and
OL,4,Ajudges to meet his pledges
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Farage has insisted a Reform UK
OL,7,Fgovernment would deliver where other
OL,8,Fparties have failed, as he set out his
OL,9,Fpriorities in his annual conference
OL,10,Fspeech.
OL,12,FHe said Reform's pledges for its first
OL,13,F100 days in power would include
OL,14,Fstopping small boat crossings, cutting
OL,15,Fenergy bills by #250 a year and ending
OL,16,Fthe net zero "lunacy".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
